@startuml EmailNotificationAPI_Sequence
!define ABOLD <b>
!define AEND </b>

title ABOLD Email Notification Service - API Sequence Diagram AEND

actor Client
participant "Controller\nEmailNotificationController" as Controller
participant "Service\nEmailNotificationService" as Service
participant "Repository\nIOrigNotificationRepository" as Repository
participant "Database\nOracle IORIG_NOTIFICATION" as Database
participant "ExceptionHandler\nGlobalExceptionHandler" as ExceptionHandler

== Success Scenario ==

Client -> Controller: POST /email/save\nApplicationEmailRequest
activate Controller

Controller -> Controller: Parse JSON Request
Controller -> Service: saveEmailNotification(request)
activate Service

Service -> Service: Validate appId\n(Not null, Not empty)

alt appId is null or empty
    Service -> ExceptionHandler: throw ApplicationException\n(status: 400)
    activate ExceptionHandler
    ExceptionHandler -> Client: 400 BAD_REQUEST\n{status: 400,\nmessage: "Application ID is required"}
    deactivate ExceptionHandler
else appId is valid
    Service -> Service: Convert Request to Entity\nIOrigNotification
    Service -> Service: Map Fields:\nappId → APP_SEQ_ID\nssn → INTF_SSN\nappStatus → INTF_STAGE\nemailId → INTF_EMAIL_ID\nsubject → INTF_SUBJECT\ncontent → INTF_CONTENT (CLOB)\nlanguageCode → INTF_LANG_CODE\ncreatedBy → INTF_CREATED_BY
    
    Service -> Repository: save(notification)
    activate Repository
    
    Repository -> Database: INSERT INTO IORIG_NOTIFICATION\n(APP_SEQ_ID, INTF_SSN, INTF_STAGE,\nINTF_EMAIL_ID, INTF_SUBJECT,\nINTF_CONTENT, INTF_LANG_CODE,\nINTF_CREATED_BY, INTF_CREATED_ON)
    activate Database
    
    Database -> Database: Generate INTF_SEQ_ID\n(via Sequence)
    Database -> Database: Set INTF_CREATED_ON\n(CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
    Database -> Database: Write CLOB Content\n(Hibernate LOB handling)
    
    Database --> Repository: Saved IOrigNotification\n(with generated ID)
    deactivate Database
    
    Repository --> Service: IOrigNotification\n(interfaceSeqId: 1)
    deactivate Repository
    
    Service -> Service: Build EmailNotificationResponse\nstatus: "SUCCESS"\nmessage: "Email notification saved successfully"\ninterfaceSeqId: 1
    
    Service --> Controller: EmailNotificationResponse
    deactivate Service
    
    Controller -> Controller: Return ResponseEntity\n(HTTP 200 OK)
    
    Controller --> Client: 200 OK\n{interfaceSeqId: 1,\nstatus: "SUCCESS",\nmessage: "Email notification saved successfully"}
end

deactivate Controller

== Error Scenario - Database Error ==

Client -> Controller: POST /email/save\nApplicationEmailRequest (valid appId)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: saveEmailNotification(request)
activate Service

Service -> Service: Validate appId ✓
Service -> Service: Convert to Entity ✓
Service -> Repository: save(notification)
activate Repository

Repository -> Database: INSERT...
activate Database

Database --> Database: Connection Error / Constraint Violation
Database --> Repository: RuntimeException
deactivate Database

Repository --> Service: RuntimeException
deactivate Repository

Service --> ExceptionHandler: Propagate Exception
activate ExceptionHandler

ExceptionHandler -> ExceptionHandler: Catch Exception
ExceptionHandler -> Client: 500 INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR\n{status: 500,\nmessage: "Internal server error: ..."}
deactivate ExceptionHandler

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller

note over Client, Database
  Key Points:
  • Content field stored as CLOB (unlimited size)
  • Sequence auto-generates INTF_SEQ_ID
  • Timestamp auto-populated by DB
  • Transactional service ensures data consistency
  • Global exception handler catches all errors
end note

@enduml
